        <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;">Notice the proof-to-rationale ratio: <strong>4 lines of <code>refl</code></strong> prove universal soundness across every symbolic 64-bit input, and <strong>3 lines of <code>refl</code></strong> lock a 1.17-million-polygon 7nm die to its exact GDSII bytes. Interact with all three real failure modes below:</p>
