      <h2>Cubical Paths, §4.5 Face Pruning &amp; Computational Univalence</h2>
      <p>Hyperactivity is not merely an interaction-net evaluator — it is a <strong>cubical dependent type theory</strong> where higher-dimensional equalities compute directly as graph rewrites.</p>
      <ul>
